{'symbol': 'BK', 'date': '2022-11-07 16:30:00', 'title': 'BNY MELLON TO SPEAK AT THE GOLDMAN SACHS 2022 US FINANCIAL SERVICES CONFERENCE', 'text': 'NEW YORK , NOV. 7, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- THE BANK OF NEW YORK MELLON CORPORATION ("BNY MELLON") (NYSE: BK) ANNOUNCED TODAY THAT EMILY PORTNEY, CHIEF FINANCIAL OFFICER, AND ROMAN REGELMAN, CHIEF EXECUTIVE OFFICER OF SECURITIES SERVICES AND DIGITAL, WILL SPEAK AT THE GOLDMAN SACHS 2022 US FINANCIAL SERVICES CONFERENCE, AT 1:00 P.M. ET ON WEDNESDAY, DECEMBER 7, 2022.'}